231537598 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="header" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"> we are hosting a LGBTQ+ focused blood drive with</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW231537598 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="header" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"> the American Red Cross </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW231537598 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="header" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">on </span></span><span data-contrast="auto" xml:lang="EN-US" lang="EN-US" class="TextRun Highlight SCXW231537598 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; outline: transparent solid 1px; font-variant-ligatures: none !important; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15px; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW231537598 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="header" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">&lt;date/time&gt;</span></span><span data-contrast="auto" xml:lang="EN-US" lang="EN-US" class="TextRun SCXW231537598 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-variant-ligatures: none !important; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15px; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif;"> at </span><span data-contrast="auto" xml:lang="EN-US" lang="EN-US" class="TextRun Highlight SCXW231537598 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; outline: transparent solid 1px; font-variant-ligatures: none !important; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15px; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW231537598 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="header" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">&lt;location&gt;</span></span><span data-contrast="auto" xml:lang="EN-US" lang="EN-US" class="TextRun SCXW231537598 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-variant-ligatures: none !important; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15px; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif;"> and we need your help to make it a lifesaving event!</span><span class="EOP SCXW231537598 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240,&quot;469777462&quot;:[4320,8640],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0,0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[3,4]}" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15px; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW231537598 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p class="Paragraph SCXW231537598 BCX8" paraid="1962478722" paraeid="{44f519bb-3ef6-461a-82bb-b4df4373460f}{231}" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent; color: windowtext;"><span data-contrast="auto" xml:lang="EN-US" lang="EN-US" class="TextRun SCXW231537598 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-variant-ligatures: none !important; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15px; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW231537598 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="header" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"></span></span><span class="EOP SCXW231537598 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240,&quot;469777462&quot;:[4320,8640],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0,0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[3,4]}" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15px; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW231537598 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p class="Paragraph SCXW231537598 BCX8" paraid="2086928208" paraeid="{44f519bb-3ef6-461a-82bb-b4df4373460f}{235}" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent; color: windowtext;"><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="EN-US" lang="EN-US" class="TextRun SCXW231537598 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15px; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW231537598 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">Did you know that in May 2023, the FDA </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW231537598 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">remov</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW231537598 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">ed sexual orientation</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW231537598 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"> from the blood donor </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW231537598 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">questionnaire</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW231537598 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">, replacing it with the Individual Donor Assessment (IDA)? </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW231537598 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">This change allows more people to donate while keeping the blood supply safe. </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW231537598 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">On August 7, 2023, the American Red Cross was the first major blood bank to implement these changes, allowing more donors to </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW231537598 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">participate</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW231537598 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"> in their lifesaving efforts!</span></span><span class="EOP SCXW231537598 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15px; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW231537598 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p class="Paragraph SCXW231537598 BCX8" paraid="945038362" paraeid="{44f519bb-3ef6-461a-82bb-b4df4373460f}{255}" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: auto 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent; color: windowtext;"><span data-contrast="auto" xml:lang="EN-US" lang="EN-US" class="TextRun SCXW231537598 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-variant-ligatures: none !important; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15px; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><spa