/span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW231537598 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">isn't</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW231537598 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"> </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW231537598 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">an option</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW231537598 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"> for you, whether by choice or eligibility, we still invite you to be part of the </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW231537598 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">larger </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW231537598 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">mission of the American Red Cross</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW231537598 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">.</span></span><span class="EOP SCXW231537598 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15px; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW231537598 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p class="Paragraph SCXW231537598 BCX8" paraid="904175549" paraeid="{c9f3283b-9b59-4569-bba8-12d8e34fccbe}{53}" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent; color: windowtext;"><span data-contrast="auto" xml:lang="EN-US" lang="EN-US" class="TextRun SCXW231537598 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-variant-ligatures: none !important; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15px; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW231537598 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"></span></span><span class="EOP SCXW231537598 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15px; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW231537598 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p class="Paragraph SCXW231537598 BCX8" paraid="220751997" paraeid="{c9f3283b-9b59-4569-bba8-12d8e34fccbe}{57}" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent; color: windowtext;"><span data-contrast="auto" xml:lang="EN-US" lang="EN-US" class="TextRun SCXW231537598 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-variant-ligatures: none !important; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15px; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif;">The rich diversity and intersectionality in the LGBTQ+ community also supports our sickle cell and Latino initiatives. </span><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="EN-US" lang="EN-US" class="TextRun SCXW231537598 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15px; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW231537598 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">For example, diverse populations are essential in addressing the ongoing demand for blood, particularly type O, which is </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW231537598 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">frequently</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW231537598 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"> in short supply and urgently needed by hospitals. Notably, 51% of Black or African American individuals and 57% of Hispanic or Latino individuals have type O blood.</span></span><span data-contrast="auto" xml:lang="EN-US" lang="EN-US" class="TextRun SCXW231537598 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-variant-ligatures: none !important; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 18px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, &quot;Times New Roman_EmbeddedFont&quot;, &quot;Times New Roman_MSFontService&quot;, serif;">&nbsp;</span><span class="EOP SCXW231537598 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 18px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, &quot;Times New Roman_EmbeddedFont&quot;, &quot;Times New Roman_MSFontService&quot;, serif;">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW231537598 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p class="Paragraph SCXW231537598 BCX8" paraid="585029292" paraeid="{c9f3283b-9b59-4569-bba8-12d8e34fccbe}{67}" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent; color: windowtext;"><span data-contrast="auto" xml:lang="EN-US" lang="EN-US" class="TextRun SCXW231537598 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-variant-ligatures: none !important; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15px; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW231537598 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="header" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"></span></span><span class="EOP SCXW231537598 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240,&quot;469777462&quot;:[4320,8640],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0,0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[3,4]}" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15px; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW231537598 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p class="Paragraph SCXW231537598 BCX8" paraid="2035699119" paraeid="{c9f3283b-9b59-4569-bba8-12d8e34fccbe}{71}" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent; color: windowtext;"><span data-contrast="auto" xml:lang="EN-US" lang="EN-US" class="TextRun SCXW231537598 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-variant-ligatures: none !important; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15px; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW231537598 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="header" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">Each blood donation can help save more than one life</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW231537598 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="header" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">. </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW231537598 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="header" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">Our service is to patients in need and the people who love them, as we band together to show our community spirit and the power of the </span></span><span data-contrast="auto" xml:lang="EN-US" lang="EN-US" class="TextRun Highlight SCXW231537598 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; outline: transparent solid 1px; font-variant-ligatures: none !important; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15px; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW231537598 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="header" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">&lt;organization&gt;</span></span><span data-contrast="auto" xml:lang="EN-US" lang="EN-US" class="TextRun SCXW231537598 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-variant-ligatures: none !important; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15px; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial